    "text": "By Ethan Genter ,\n9 hours ago When Robert Manning was growing up in Hyannis, his eyes were opened to the wealth disparity that comes with living in a Massachusetts coastal resort community. “I had held a series of summer jobs that exposed me to the more affluent,” he said. “While most were kind, others were not as nice. As a young and impressionable person, that had a huge impact on how I would interact with people for the rest of my life.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
